{
  "name": "formatString · 嵌套 ${...} 表达式（Nested Expressions）",
  "description": "验证 A2UI v0.9 规范明文支持的 formatString 嵌套 ${...} 语法三种形态：(1) Explicit Binding —— ${formatDate(value:${/at}, format:'yyyy-MM-dd')} 用 ${...} 显式标注 value 参数是 path；(2) Nested Functions（跨类型嵌套，number 类）—— ${formatCurrency(value:${formatNumber(value:${/price}, decimals:2)}, currency:'USD')} 一个函数结果作为另一个函数的 number 参数（引擎会剥离千分位后再 parse）；(3) Nested Functions（同类型嵌套，string 类）—— ${formatString(value:'...')} 一个 formatString 作为另一个 formatString 的参数。参照 a2ui_protocol.md §formatString nested interpolation。期望渲染结果：t_explicit → 'Explicit binding: date = 2025-12-15'；t_nested_func → 'Nested functions: price = $1,234.50'；t_nested_string → 'Nested string: greeting = hi Alice!'；t_combined → 'Combined: Alice paid $1,234.50 on Dec 15, 2025'。",
  "messages": [
    {
      "version": "v0.9",
      "createSurface": {
        "surfaceId": "fn-fs-9",
        "catalogId": "https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/catalogs/basic/catalog.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "version": "v0.9",
      "updateComponents": {
        "surfaceId": "fn-fs-9",
        "components": [
          { "id": "root", "component": "Card", "child": "col" },
          {
            "id": "col",
            "component": "Column",
            "children": ["title", "t_explicit", "t_nested_func", "t_nested_string", "t_combined"]
          },
          {
            "id": "title",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "formatString 嵌套 ${...} 表达式",
            "variant": "h5"
          },
          {
            "id": "t_explicit",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": {
              "call": "formatString",
              "args": {
                "value": "Explicit binding: date = ${formatDate(value:${/at}, format:'yyyy-MM-dd')}"
              },
              "returnType": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "t_nested_func",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": {
              "call": "formatString",
              "args": {
                "value": "Nested functions: price = ${formatCurrency(value:${formatNumber(value:${/price}, decimals:2)}, currency:'USD')}"
              },
              "returnType": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "t_nested_string",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": {
              "call": "formatString",
              "args": {
                "value": "Nested string: greeting = ${formatString(value:'hi ${/user/name}!')}"
              },
              "returnType": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "t_combined",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": {
              "call": "formatString",
              "args": {
                "value": "Combined: ${/user/name} paid ${formatCurrency(value:${/price}, currency:'USD')} on ${formatDate(value:${/at}, format:'MMM d, yyyy')}"
              },
              "returnType": "string"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "version": "v0.9",
      "updateDataModel": {
        "surfaceId": "fn-fs-9",
        "value": {
          "user": { "name": "Alice" },
          "price": 1234.5,
          "at": "2025-12-15T17:30:00Z"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
